     "problem_md": "Joe streams a radio show online.\n\nDescribe what is meant by ‘streaming’.",
     "solution_md": "> **[mark-scheme]**\n> A description such as:\n> \n> - Downloading/uploading only a part of the audio (1) so that it can be played without having to wait for the download/upload to finish (1)\n> - Video/sound/media that is downloaded/shared/buffered (1) while being played/watched (1)\n> \n> Example of a common response that gains two marks:\n> “The ability to play a file without it being fully downloaded”",
